WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.800
Episode 20

01:37.820 --> 01:40.200
Prime Minister, what do you mean?

01:41.860 --> 01:44.070
If I keep thinking of him,

01:44.090 --> 01:48.730
how could I focus on supporting you?

01:50.900 --> 01:52.770
Now that it has happened,

01:53.650 --> 01:56.050
you have to be careful of the Crown Prince.

01:56.540 --> 01:57.960
Do you think

01:57.980 --> 01:59.390
he wants to kill me?

01:59.410 --> 02:01.240
There are two reasons.

02:02.450 --> 02:03.730
First,

02:04.500 --> 02:07.050
you'll take over Neiku

02:07.370 --> 02:09.480
from Li Yunrui.

02:11.980 --> 02:14.280
She is Wan'er's birth mother.

02:14.570 --> 02:16.400
I didn't mean to offend her.

02:16.850 --> 02:18.330
Second,

02:19.210 --> 02:20.890
you've been supporting the Second Prince

02:21.620 --> 02:24.280
since you came to the capital city.

02:24.820 --> 02:27.040
The Crown Prince is not happy about that.

02:27.540 --> 02:29.190
I just met the Second Prince a few times.

02:29.210 --> 02:30.640
I'm not his supporter.

02:30.820 --> 02:32.810
You should have avoided seeing him.

02:33.290 --> 02:35.040
The capital city is a dangerous place.

02:35.340 --> 02:37.910
If you didn't choose to support someone,

02:37.930 --> 02:39.180
it could

02:39.180 --> 02:41.450
lead to your doom.

02:42.370 --> 02:43.970
What should I do?

02:44.540 --> 02:49.040
From now on, remain neutral.

02:49.060 --> 02:50.330
Try your best

02:50.370 --> 02:52.640
to avoid seeing either of them.

02:53.010 --> 02:54.840
But you just said

02:54.980 --> 02:57.120
I should choose to support someone.

02:57.340 --> 03:01.200
Now that you're my son-in-law,

03:01.540 --> 03:04.730
you'll be on my side.

03:10.420 --> 03:12.630
But if the Crown Prince holds a grudge against me,

03:12.650 --> 03:13.800
I'm afraid you'll get into trouble because of me

03:13.820 --> 03:15.920
when he succeeds to the throne.

03:16.780 --> 03:19.920
I'll try to act as a mediator.

03:20.060 --> 03:23.200
If he keeps treating you as an enemy,

03:24.700 --> 03:27.000
I'll help

03:28.180 --> 03:29.610
someone else

03:31.290 --> 03:32.840
succeed to the throne.

03:47.140 --> 03:48.140
It turns out it's not blue

03:48.140 --> 03:50.250
when there is little water.

03:52.900 --> 03:55.560
But I've never seen the sea.

03:57.340 --> 03:59.280
I can take you to see it in the future.

04:02.650 --> 04:04.730
Elder brother, are you done talking?

04:06.850 --> 04:07.960
Dabao,

04:07.980 --> 04:09.760
I'm going to marry your younger sister.

04:09.780 --> 04:12.530
So, you'll be my elder brother.

04:15.620 --> 04:16.860
Are you going to marry Wan'er?

04:16.860 --> 04:17.590
Yeah.

04:17.610 --> 04:18.860
She's a nice girl.

04:18.860 --> 04:19.890
She's never scolded me.

04:19.890 --> 04:20.420
Besides,

04:20.420 --> 04:21.090
She...

04:21.090 --> 04:23.010
She also treats me on cakes.

04:23.210 --> 04:24.870
I'll treat you on cakes too.

04:24.890 --> 04:25.490
Really?

04:25.490 --> 04:26.030
Yes.

04:26.050 --> 04:27.000
So,

04:27.020 --> 04:28.370
will you take me to see the sea?

04:28.370 --> 04:28.960
Sure.

04:28.980 --> 04:29.770
We have to

04:29.770 --> 04:30.680
take Wan'er with us.

04:30.700 --> 04:31.750
Go!

04:31.770 --> 04:32.840
Hi, Mr. Yuan.

04:32.860 --> 04:34.320
Let's go.

04:37.420 --> 04:38.560
Trust me.

04:38.580 --> 04:40.190
I'll take Wan'er with me no matter where I go.

04:40.210 --> 04:41.440
That would be great.

04:41.650 --> 04:42.800
How about Erbao?

04:42.820 --> 04:43.720
What?

04:43.740 --> 04:44.370
Shall we

04:44.370 --> 04:46.250
take Erbao with us?

04:54.050 --> 04:55.410
Dabao,

04:56.820 --> 04:58.440
Erbao

04:58.820 --> 05:01.250
has gone somewhere far far away.

05:02.580 --> 05:04.480
You probably won't see him for a long time.

05:05.370 --> 05:07.250
Is he dead?

05:11.420 --> 05:15.190
I once raised kittens

05:15.210 --> 05:16.920
and bunnies.

05:17.370 --> 05:20.200
But they were gone later.

05:20.330 --> 05:22.680
I looked,

05:22.700 --> 05:23.520
looked,

05:23.540 --> 05:25.330
and looked for them.

05:25.330 --> 05:27.150
But I failed to find them.

05:27.170 --> 05:29.400
A maidservant told me

05:29.420 --> 05:31.250
they're dead.

05:31.860 --> 05:34.720
I asked Wan'er what it means.

05:35.580 --> 05:37.200
She said

05:37.490 --> 05:38.610
it means

05:38.610 --> 05:41.160
they've gone somewhere far far away

05:41.490 --> 05:43.590
and I won't see them

05:43.610 --> 05:46.130
for a long, long time.

05:46.490 --> 05:49.370
Someday,

05:50.300 --> 05:52.410
I'll also go there.

05:53.890 --> 05:56.480
Then I'll see them again.

05:59.330 --> 06:02.090
So, in the future,

06:03.650 --> 06:04.820
I'll go to

06:04.820 --> 06:07.130
that faraway place.

06:07.740 --> 06:09.970
I'll see my kittens,

06:11.820 --> 06:13.410
my bunnies

06:14.860 --> 06:16.480
and Erbao.

06:25.540 --> 06:27.120
When I see them again,

06:27.140 --> 06:27.740
I...

06:27.740 --> 06:29.190
I'll tell them

06:29.210 --> 06:32.720
it has been a long time and I miss them.

06:40.170 --> 06:43.690
Okay. You can say that.

06:45.370 --> 06:46.330
Wan'er also likes to

06:46.330 --> 06:48.040
touch my head like this.

06:48.140 --> 06:49.720
It's comfortable.

06:50.260 --> 06:51.600
Elder brother,

06:51.650 --> 06:53.590
the two of you are quite alike.

06:53.610 --> 06:55.000
Dabao,

06:55.020 --> 06:56.800
I told you you'll be my elder brother.

06:56.820 --> 06:57.630
Listen to me.

06:57.650 --> 06:59.320
Don't call me like that again.

07:00.700 --> 07:02.000
Are you younger than me?

07:02.020 --> 07:03.070
Yeah. I'm younger than you.

07:03.090 --> 07:04.570
Call me Fan Xian.

07:04.610 --> 07:05.810
Fan...

07:06.610 --> 07:09.880
Can I call you Xianxian?

07:12.210 --> 07:13.370
Dabao,

07:14.540 --> 07:16.290
this name

07:17.260 --> 07:19.040
sounds weird.

07:19.210 --> 07:20.400
Xianxian.

07:20.420 --> 07:21.280
Don't call me like that.

07:21.300 --> 07:22.490
-Xianxian. -Stop calling me like that.

07:22.490 --> 07:25.750
Xianxian! Xianxian! Xianxian!

07:25.770 --> 07:27.600
I've told the Crown Prince about it.

07:28.170 --> 07:30.130
He didn't say anything.

07:31.820 --> 07:33.880
It's okay as long as he knew it.

07:34.170 --> 07:35.290
Your Excellency,

07:36.490 --> 07:37.890
Are you sure

07:37.890 --> 07:39.490
you'll entrust the future of your daughter and your clan

07:39.490 --> 07:42.200
to Fan Xian?

07:43.460 --> 07:44.920
I saw

07:45.820 --> 07:48.800
Fan Xian play with Dabao.

07:48.820 --> 07:50.640
So did I.

07:50.860 --> 07:52.160
Actually,

07:52.820 --> 07:55.320
even the servants in my mansion

07:55.770 --> 07:57.440
will laugh at Dabao

07:57.740 --> 07:59.580
behind my back

07:59.580 --> 08:01.280
when they see him.

08:01.300 --> 08:03.590
I know most of them

08:03.610 --> 08:05.480
look down upon him

08:06.090 --> 08:08.320
and are impatient with talking to him.

08:08.770 --> 08:11.200
But Fan Xian smiled from the bottom of his heart

08:11.610 --> 08:16.630
when he stayed with Dabao.

08:16.650 --> 08:18.010
It's true.

08:19.170 --> 08:21.610
It seems Fan Xian treats Dabao

08:21.610 --> 08:23.160
as his friend.

08:23.890 --> 08:25.850
In that very moment,

08:26.540 --> 08:28.160
I decided to

08:29.140 --> 08:32.010
rely on him for our future

08:33.610 --> 08:38.520
if he has nothing to do

08:38.900 --> 08:40.840
with Gong'er's death.

08:48.170 --> 08:50.150
Alright. Let's say goodbye here.

08:50.170 --> 08:52.650
Go back. I'll come some other day.

08:53.460 --> 08:56.160
You were not called in by my dad.

08:56.850 --> 08:58.450
What?

09:01.260 --> 09:02.590
Those who are called in by my dad

09:02.610 --> 09:04.560
don't like to play with me.

09:04.580 --> 09:06.290
They only smile at me

09:06.290 --> 09:08.120
when dad is around.

09:08.140 --> 09:09.440
They ignore me

09:09.460 --> 09:11.520
if dad is not around.

09:12.660 --> 09:13.710
Did you tell your dad

09:13.730 --> 09:15.240
about it?

09:15.260 --> 09:16.270
No.

09:16.290 --> 09:17.270
You can't!

09:17.290 --> 09:18.510
I'm telling you.

09:18.530 --> 09:20.390
You can't tell my dad.

09:20.410 --> 09:22.130
If you do,

09:22.220 --> 09:24.030
he'll scold them

09:24.050 --> 09:26.400
and they'll feel depressed.

09:29.020 --> 09:30.280
Dabao,

09:30.340 --> 09:31.220
do you know how long

09:31.220 --> 09:32.520
I've been in the capital city?

09:33.530 --> 09:34.880
No.

09:34.900 --> 09:37.590
Since I came here from Danzhou,

09:37.610 --> 09:39.030
I've met many people and

09:39.050 --> 09:40.690
many things have happened.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.470
But in my opinion,

09:42.490 --> 09:43.370
you're more lovely

09:43.370 --> 09:44.770
than most of them.

09:46.100 --> 09:47.650
Danzhou?

09:47.930 --> 09:50.370
Do you mean I'm a good guy?

09:50.410 --> 09:52.570
Yes, you're.

09:52.930 --> 09:54.410
Xianxian, remember

09:54.410 --> 09:55.730
to often come play with me.

09:55.730 --> 09:57.370
I told you not to call...

09:57.660 --> 10:00.450
Okay. I promise.

10:01.490 --> 10:02.910
Then, go home.

10:02.930 --> 10:03.680
If you don't,

10:03.700 --> 10:05.720
your dad will also scold you.

10:06.610 --> 10:07.770
I'm leaving.

10:08.140 --> 10:08.880
Remember.

10:08.900 --> 10:09.830
Don't pick up food

10:09.850 --> 10:11.260
that's thrown away by others.

10:11.260 --> 10:12.120
Got it.

10:12.140 --> 10:13.530
Don't jump in puddles.

10:13.530 --> 10:15.020
Don't grab others' candy.

10:15.020 --> 10:16.080
Got it.

10:16.100 --> 10:17.280
And,

10:17.340 --> 10:18.050
remember

10:18.050 --> 10:19.910
to put on clothes before you go out.

10:19.930 --> 10:21.000
Got it.

10:21.020 --> 10:22.170
Remember

10:22.170 --> 10:23.350
to use chopsticks when you have a meal.

10:23.370 --> 10:24.950
Don't eat with your hands.

10:24.970 --> 10:26.810
Got it.

10:34.610 --> 10:35.840
Your Excellency.

10:35.970 --> 10:37.240
Why is it you again?

10:37.260 --> 10:38.150
Of course it's me.

10:38.170 --> 10:39.840
Are you expecting someone else?

10:39.970 --> 10:41.560
You told me

10:41.580 --> 10:43.640
to send your sister to the Eastern Palace.

10:43.660 --> 10:44.700
The Crown Prince didn't come to

10:44.700 --> 10:46.000
the Prime Minister Mansion to catch me.

10:46.020 --> 10:46.970
Yeah.

10:46.970 --> 10:47.780
Lady Ruoruo stayed there for a long time

10:47.780 --> 10:49.200
before she came out.

10:49.220 --> 10:50.470
I'd been waiting for her.

10:50.490 --> 10:51.240
She said

10:51.260 --> 10:52.390
it's too slow to come over in a sedan chair.

10:52.410 --> 10:53.850
She asked me to come here first.

10:53.850 --> 10:55.210
What's the matter?

10:56.020 --> 10:58.250
The Crown Prince left.

10:58.410 --> 11:00.200
He might have gone to the bathroom.

11:00.220 --> 11:01.240
Please don't crack a joke.

11:01.260 --> 11:02.240
He didn't go to the bathroom.

11:02.260 --> 11:04.140
He left the Eastern Palace.

11:04.140 --> 11:05.240
I see. It's a serious matter.

11:05.260 --> 11:06.390
Where is he going?

11:06.410 --> 11:08.040
The Investigator's Office.

11:10.660 --> 11:12.200
Why does he want to go there?

11:12.220 --> 11:13.080
Lady Ruoruo said

11:13.100 --> 11:15.250
he's going to see Si Lili.

11:22.820 --> 11:23.930
Your Highness, are you going to

11:23.930 --> 11:25.120
the Investigator's Office to see Si Lili?

11:25.140 --> 11:26.240
Yes.

11:26.260 --> 11:28.520
You don't need to follow me there.

11:28.660 --> 11:29.880
Your Highness,

11:29.900 --> 11:31.830
you don't believe what Mr. Yuan said, right?

11:31.850 --> 11:34.030
I don't believe what Si Lili said.

11:34.050 --> 11:37.120
So, are you going to interrogate her again?

11:37.140 --> 11:38.600
On the contrary,

11:38.970 --> 11:40.810
I'm going to save her.

11:43.290 --> 11:45.830
He wants to save Si Lili.

11:45.850 --> 11:47.080
Lady Ruoruo also asked the Crown Prince

11:47.100 --> 11:48.590
why he wants to do that.

11:48.610 --> 11:49.800
He said,

11:49.820 --> 11:50.680
now that

11:50.700 --> 11:52.150
you interrogated Si Lili alone,

11:52.170 --> 11:53.640
it means it's possible

11:53.660 --> 11:55.580
you've known Lin Gong's issue,

11:55.580 --> 11:56.970
but you told Si Lili

11:56.970 --> 11:59.010
not to tell anyone else about it.

12:00.460 --> 12:01.340
Why would Si Lili

12:01.340 --> 12:03.200
listen to my brother?

12:03.220 --> 12:05.950
Why would she rather suffer cruel torture
than tell the truth?

12:05.970 --> 12:06.660
Because Fan Xian

12:06.660 --> 12:08.800
would promise to spare her life in return

12:08.820 --> 12:10.800
if she keeps the secret.

12:10.820 --> 12:12.240
I'll never break my promise.

12:12.260 --> 12:13.590
Tell me his name

12:13.610 --> 12:15.570
and I'll keep you safe.

12:16.700 --> 12:18.320
Lady Ruoruo wanted me to ask you

12:18.340 --> 12:19.950
if you promised

12:19.970 --> 12:21.290
to keep Si Lili safe

12:21.290 --> 12:22.720
just as the Crown Prince said.

12:25.260 --> 12:26.960
I want you to trust me.

12:27.290 --> 12:29.030
I am the only one

12:29.050 --> 12:30.810
who is willing to keep you alive

12:31.610 --> 12:33.130
in the capital city now.

12:39.370 --> 12:40.520
Okay.

12:41.100 --> 12:43.650
Your Excellency.

12:44.290 --> 12:45.350
What else did the Crown Prince say?

12:45.370 --> 12:46.470
He said

12:46.490 --> 12:48.680
he'd swear in the name of his identity as the Crown Prince

12:48.700 --> 12:50.440
he'd get Si Lili out of the dungeon

12:50.460 --> 12:52.260
and keep her safe

12:52.260 --> 12:53.810
if she tells the truth.

12:56.020 --> 12:57.270
Let's go to the Investigator's Office.

12:57.290 --> 13:00.150
Your Excellency, don't panic so much.

13:00.170 --> 13:01.510
Maybe Miss Si Lili

13:01.530 --> 13:03.150
is still passionately devoted to you

13:03.170 --> 13:04.320
and refuses to say anything.

13:04.340 --> 13:05.140
Si Lili wouldn't

13:05.140 --> 13:06.050
tell the truth

13:06.050 --> 13:07.760
just for one reason,

13:07.780 --> 13:08.580
that is, she knows that

13:08.580 --> 13:10.120
the Investigator's Office thinks highly of me.

13:10.140 --> 13:10.930
So, she wouldn't tell the truth

13:10.930 --> 13:12.270
as long as she's imprisoned

13:12.290 --> 13:13.800
in the Investigator's Office.

13:13.820 --> 13:16.050
If she knows the Crown Prince would save her...

13:16.050 --> 13:18.280
She'll sell me down the river.

13:18.460 --> 13:20.470
If Si Lili tells the truth,

13:20.490 --> 13:22.080
the Crown Prince, the Prime Minister

13:22.100 --> 13:23.570
and even His Majesty

13:23.700 --> 13:24.410
would think

13:24.410 --> 13:26.370
it's me that killed Lin Gong.

13:58.660 --> 13:59.960
It's too late.

14:05.850 --> 14:07.260
Your Excellency, you have to find a way

14:07.260 --> 14:08.100
to stop the Crown Prince.

14:08.100 --> 14:09.020
If I stand out at this moment,

14:09.020 --> 14:10.770
it means I admit I did everything.

14:13.050 --> 14:14.520
I have an idea.

14:14.580 --> 14:16.350
I'll try to delay the Crown Prince

14:16.370 --> 14:17.970
and you go to the dungeon

14:17.970 --> 14:19.650
and kill Si Lili.

14:21.930 --> 14:23.640
I promised not to kill her.

14:23.660 --> 14:25.390
It's urgent.

14:25.410 --> 14:27.470
You'll die if she's alive.

14:27.490 --> 14:28.800
But it's of no use to kill her.

14:28.820 --> 14:30.200
If Si Lili is killed at this moment,

14:30.220 --> 14:31.960
it just proves I want to do away with a witness.

14:32.530 --> 14:33.530
We can say

14:33.530 --> 14:35.950
it's the secret agents from Beiqi that did it.

14:35.970 --> 14:36.900
Do you know why the Crown Prince

14:36.900 --> 14:38.170
told Ruoruo the reason

14:38.170 --> 14:39.590
why he'd come to the Investigator's Office?

14:39.610 --> 14:40.270
Why?

14:40.290 --> 14:41.100
Because he has never believed

14:41.100 --> 14:42.760
Ruoruo would support himself.

14:42.780 --> 14:44.150
He told her about it

14:44.170 --> 14:45.560
just to let her send word to me

14:45.580 --> 14:47.080
so that I'd respond.

14:48.530 --> 14:50.470
So, what can we do to solve the dilemma?

14:50.490 --> 14:51.900
I just hope

14:51.900 --> 14:53.050
someone can stop him

14:53.050 --> 14:54.510
from entering the Investigator's Office,

14:54.530 --> 14:56.470
or I'll come to the end of a blind alley.

14:56.490 --> 14:58.650
But the Crown Prince is so powerful.

15:00.170 --> 15:01.770
Wait. There is still hope.

15:02.100 --> 15:04.470
His Majesty once said

15:04.490 --> 15:06.580
Their Highnesses shall not meddle

15:06.580 --> 15:08.320
in the Investigator's Office's affairs.

15:08.340 --> 15:09.080
Besides,

15:09.100 --> 15:09.700
the directors of divisions

15:09.700 --> 15:11.480
wouldn't let him in.

15:11.780 --> 15:13.250
I hope so.

15:16.530 --> 15:17.960
There they are.

15:43.700 --> 15:45.160
Line up!

15:50.820 --> 15:54.450
Mr. Zhu, please step aside.

15:55.660 --> 15:58.710
Your Highness, His Majesty said

15:58.730 --> 16:01.130
princes can't come inside.

16:02.580 --> 16:04.570
Do you want to stop me?

16:06.290 --> 16:08.010
He wants to stop me.

16:09.490 --> 16:10.640
I dare not.

16:10.660 --> 16:13.800
It's His Majesty's order. I hardly dare disobey it.

16:13.820 --> 16:15.010
Okay.

16:15.370 --> 16:16.470
From now on,

16:16.490 --> 16:17.760
I'll start to go inside.

16:17.780 --> 16:19.140
And I won't stop

16:19.140 --> 16:20.170
unless

16:20.170 --> 16:21.650
you take actions.

16:21.970 --> 16:25.910
Your Highness, if you insist on doing it,

16:25.930 --> 16:27.660
His Majesty will fly into a rage.

16:27.660 --> 16:29.600
Do you dare to take actions?

16:43.340 --> 16:45.510
The Investigator's Office is of great importance.

16:45.530 --> 16:46.710
It's the lifeblood of the imperial court.

16:46.730 --> 16:48.440
Your Highness, if you step forward again,

16:48.460 --> 16:50.400
I'll draw my sword.

16:50.580 --> 16:52.560
I just dare not disobey His Majesty's order.

16:52.580 --> 16:54.200
I'll have no other choice

16:54.220 --> 16:55.580
but to knock you out

16:55.580 --> 16:57.350
and then take you to His Majesty.

16:57.370 --> 16:59.080
I see.

16:59.260 --> 17:01.710
Do you think you can

17:01.730 --> 17:02.370
stop my picked guards

17:02.370 --> 17:04.800
by yourself alone?

17:14.340 --> 17:15.650
Draw your swords!

17:21.340 --> 17:24.320
Your Highness, here is the capital city.

17:24.340 --> 17:25.860
How will you explain it to His Majesty?

17:25.860 --> 17:27.630
Lin Gong is my good friend.

17:27.650 --> 17:29.600
For both private and public reasons,

17:29.620 --> 17:30.740
I'll find out the truth.

17:30.740 --> 17:32.890
The Investigator's Office will do it.

17:32.890 --> 17:34.150
I don't trust you.

17:34.170 --> 17:35.370
Step aside!

17:39.130 --> 17:40.910
The Crown Prince is so tough.

17:40.930 --> 17:42.080
I'm dead.

17:42.250 --> 17:43.050
His Excellency Yan and His Excellency Zhu.

17:43.050 --> 17:43.890
are trying to stop him.

17:43.890 --> 17:45.250
They couldn't do it.

17:45.890 --> 17:47.800
I've underestimated the Crown Prince.

17:47.890 --> 17:48.910
Such being the case,

17:48.930 --> 17:50.960
all our plans in the capital city will come to nothing.

17:50.980 --> 17:52.370
Wang Qinian,

17:52.530 --> 17:53.460
I'll find a way

17:53.460 --> 17:54.440
to get out of the capital city.

17:54.460 --> 17:54.860
You just pretend

17:54.860 --> 17:56.110
you know nothing about it.

17:56.130 --> 17:57.840
They won't make things difficult for you.

17:59.700 --> 18:01.050
Your Excellency.

18:02.650 --> 18:04.600
Farewell, Wang Qinian.

18:04.620 --> 18:05.770
Your Excellency.

18:06.290 --> 18:08.250
-Step aside! -Listen.

18:09.010 --> 18:10.110
What's the noise?

18:10.130 --> 18:12.010
Go!

18:50.100 --> 18:51.650
Black knights!

19:10.290 --> 19:11.600
Disarm them.

19:19.100 --> 19:20.560
-Head. -Head.

19:22.580 --> 19:24.320
What's wrong?

19:25.820 --> 19:27.720
I've got a cold.

19:27.740 --> 19:29.720
I'll send for an imperial physician.

19:29.740 --> 19:31.480
Don't bother.

19:45.720 --> 19:47.830
=Chen Pingping, Head of the Investigator's Office=

19:51.380 --> 19:53.010
What happened to his legs?

19:54.930 --> 19:56.250
That very year,

19:56.530 --> 19:58.560
Head Chen travelled hundreds of miles

19:58.580 --> 19:59.990
with black knights

20:00.010 --> 20:01.130
and defeated Xiao En,

20:01.130 --> 20:02.630
the No.1 villain of Beiqi.

20:02.650 --> 20:04.290
However, he was injured during that battle

20:04.930 --> 20:06.960
and couldn't walk since then.

20:12.410 --> 20:14.170
Your Highness, please go back.

20:15.620 --> 20:16.930
Go away!

20:18.530 --> 20:20.800
Chen Pingping, you're so powerful.

20:21.460 --> 20:23.250
Someone said

20:23.340 --> 20:26.480
you're only second to one person in the capital city.

20:27.930 --> 20:29.840
Your Highness, you misheard it.

20:35.220 --> 20:37.130
I've heard black knights

20:37.130 --> 20:39.800
are good at fighting and have killed numerous people.

20:41.380 --> 20:44.600
Do they dare to kill a Crown Prince?

20:45.100 --> 20:47.250
Or will you do it yourself?

20:50.290 --> 20:52.250
Attacking a Crown Prince

20:52.700 --> 20:54.250
is not something a loyal subject should do.

20:54.250 --> 20:56.650
Then you couldn't stop me.

20:59.530 --> 21:01.050
Go away!

21:01.770 --> 21:04.320
Go away!

21:04.930 --> 21:06.680
He's so tough.

21:08.650 --> 21:10.170
What are you doing?

21:11.100 --> 21:13.650
Go away!

21:25.010 --> 21:26.560
Protect His Highness.

21:27.290 --> 21:28.680
Go away!

21:28.700 --> 21:29.800
Chen Pingping!

21:29.820 --> 21:30.600
Let go of me.

21:30.620 --> 21:33.320
Chen Pingping!

21:36.050 --> 21:37.600
Chen Pingping!

21:37.820 --> 21:39.030
Protecting Crown Prince

21:39.050 --> 21:40.130
against assassinations

21:40.130 --> 21:43.370
is what a loyal subject should do.

22:04.220 --> 22:05.390
Master Shadow.

22:05.410 --> 22:07.050
Head wants to see you.

22:18.890 --> 22:21.560
I've been thinking about

22:21.620 --> 22:23.600
why black knights showed up at that time

22:23.620 --> 22:25.480
when I chased Si Lili out of town.

22:25.500 --> 22:26.460
How did they know

22:26.460 --> 22:28.010
about my whereabouts?

22:28.410 --> 22:29.750
Seeing you throw a dagger,

22:29.770 --> 22:31.680
I finally understand.

22:34.860 --> 22:37.200
It's true that Head asked me

22:37.220 --> 22:39.130
to stay and serve you.

22:39.130 --> 22:40.910
It's also you that sent secret messages

22:40.930 --> 22:42.410
to black knights, right?

22:44.220 --> 22:47.030
He and I

22:47.050 --> 22:50.440
are closest to Head.

22:50.740 --> 22:53.200
You can leave. I'll tell him everything.

22:53.380 --> 22:54.720
Got it.

23:08.890 --> 23:11.030
You prove yourself to be Head of the Investigator's Office.

23:11.050 --> 23:12.560
Nobody else could be

23:12.580 --> 23:14.840
more scheming and calculating than you.

23:16.380 --> 23:18.050
Push me in.

24:02.580 --> 24:05.250
Why are you looking at me? Anything on my face?

24:05.410 --> 24:06.960
Come closer.

24:19.170 --> 24:23.290
You should wear more. Don't catch a cold.

24:28.500 --> 24:30.290
You have her eyes.

24:40.250 --> 24:42.270
At that time, she just stood there.

24:42.290 --> 24:43.680
I asked her

24:44.250 --> 24:45.960
what flowers she wanted to plant

24:45.980 --> 24:47.930
when the Investigator's Office was just set up.

24:48.500 --> 24:50.170
I'd find them no matter how precious they are

24:50.530 --> 24:53.050
as long as she told me.

24:53.580 --> 24:55.110
She scattered those wildflower seeds

24:55.130 --> 24:57.480
she got by the roadside

24:57.620 --> 24:59.820
alongside the wall at random.

24:59.820 --> 25:01.250
She said,

25:01.290 --> 25:02.960
we didn't need to grow flowers

25:03.980 --> 25:05.530
because these seeds

25:06.290 --> 25:08.840
would find their own way of living.

25:13.770 --> 25:15.410
Who is she?

25:17.340 --> 25:20.720
Ye Qingmei. Your mother.

25:20.740 --> 25:22.290
Who's Ye Qingmei?

25:22.340 --> 25:23.870
Wuzhu is in the capital city?

25:23.890 --> 25:25.410
Who is Wuzhu?

25:25.460 --> 25:27.110
He killed Lin Gong.

25:27.130 --> 25:27.890
The truth hasn't been found out

25:27.890 --> 25:29.440
about Lin Gong's death.

25:36.650 --> 25:38.170
You don't believe me.

25:40.580 --> 25:41.930
It's alright.

25:42.890 --> 25:45.530
I'll take care of the rest about Lin Gong's issue.

25:52.120 --> 25:54.490
The Imperial Study

26:01.290 --> 26:01.930
Your Highness.

26:01.930 --> 26:02.620
I want to see His Majesty.

26:02.620 --> 26:04.800
Your Highness, what's the matter?

26:13.890 --> 26:15.170
Your Majesty,

26:15.700 --> 26:18.270
His Highness wants to see you.

26:18.290 --> 26:19.480
He said

26:19.500 --> 26:21.980
he guessed

26:21.980 --> 26:24.600
the real murderer

26:24.650 --> 26:26.030
who killed Lin Gong.

26:26.050 --> 26:27.560
Who does he think it is?

26:27.740 --> 26:30.410
I hardly dare say.

26:32.220 --> 26:34.410
I'm not asking for your opinion.

26:35.100 --> 26:36.410
Just repeat his words.

26:37.820 --> 26:39.680
His Highness said

26:40.740 --> 26:45.080
it's probably the Second Prince.

27:04.930 --> 27:07.360
Your Excellency Wang, why are you sitting here?

27:07.380 --> 27:08.320
Your Excellency,

27:08.340 --> 27:10.110
please don't call me like that.

27:10.130 --> 27:11.960
You're a trusted follower of Head.

27:11.980 --> 27:13.560
You're closest to him.

27:13.580 --> 27:15.050
I'll have to rely on you

27:15.050 --> 27:16.480
in the Investigator's Office.

27:16.500 --> 27:19.080
Your Excellency, please don't say that.

27:19.100 --> 27:20.270
Actually,

27:20.290 --> 27:22.650
we just made a deal.

27:23.130 --> 27:24.560
What is it?

27:24.580 --> 27:25.800
Your Excellency.

27:27.890 --> 27:30.650
Your Excellency. Your Excellency.

27:31.340 --> 27:32.680
Actually,

27:33.100 --> 27:35.890
I planned to quit the Investigator's Office,

27:37.050 --> 27:38.220
but Head Chen

27:38.220 --> 27:39.840
offered me something

27:39.860 --> 27:41.630
and asked me to stay and serve you

27:41.650 --> 27:43.650
before he came back to the capital city.

27:43.740 --> 27:45.080
At first,

27:45.100 --> 27:47.480
I didn't plan to accept it.

27:47.580 --> 27:49.960
But since I met you at the gate of the capital city,

27:49.980 --> 27:52.200
I began to think about it.

27:52.290 --> 27:53.230
Later on,

27:53.250 --> 27:55.290
I watched you for several days.

27:55.380 --> 27:56.680
I found

27:57.380 --> 27:59.360
you're not only handsome and brave,

27:59.380 --> 28:01.100
but also noble-minded.

28:01.100 --> 28:03.630
I admire you so much

28:03.650 --> 28:04.530
that I decided to

28:04.530 --> 28:06.220
stay here

28:06.220 --> 28:07.990
and serve you.

28:08.010 --> 28:09.370
Tell me the truth.

28:10.530 --> 28:13.030
You're generous with your money.

28:13.050 --> 28:14.770
That's why I admire you.

28:17.250 --> 28:19.530
Why did you want to quit?

28:23.620 --> 28:25.750
Over the years,

28:25.770 --> 28:28.510
the Investigator's Office has done a lot

28:28.530 --> 28:30.560
and readjusted the administration of officials.

28:30.770 --> 28:32.410
I'd have a bright future

28:32.410 --> 28:34.250
if I stay here.

28:34.460 --> 28:35.820
But I don't think

28:35.820 --> 28:37.820
I still have

28:37.820 --> 28:39.440
the ambition.

28:39.460 --> 28:41.220
I don't want to be promoted again.

28:41.220 --> 28:44.390
Speaking of it, maybe I'm too soft-hearted

28:44.410 --> 28:45.840
to bear the sight of

28:45.860 --> 28:48.600
those harsh punishments.

28:48.740 --> 28:50.030
Is it by Chen Pingping's order?

28:50.050 --> 28:51.870
Of course not.

28:51.890 --> 28:53.560
Head once said

28:53.580 --> 28:55.600
such torture can be used

28:55.620 --> 28:57.230
to deal with enemies,

28:57.250 --> 28:59.600
but should never be used on one of us.

29:00.130 --> 29:01.770
Nobody would listen to him?

29:03.620 --> 29:05.410
There is something you don't know.

29:05.580 --> 29:06.720
Nowadays,

29:06.740 --> 29:08.840
there are more and more people

29:08.860 --> 29:11.010
who're willing to die for Nanqing.

29:12.010 --> 29:13.320
They're so loyal

29:13.340 --> 29:14.380
that they can't tolerate

29:14.380 --> 29:16.600
a little mistake.

29:16.650 --> 29:17.770
Then they've become

29:17.770 --> 29:19.840
more and more ruthless.

29:20.170 --> 29:21.010
Even Head

29:21.010 --> 29:23.410
can dare not criticize such loyalty.

29:23.820 --> 29:27.370
I'm lazy by nature.

29:27.410 --> 29:28.500
I failed to change with the times.

29:28.500 --> 29:30.600
I failed to keep pace with them.

29:30.620 --> 29:31.870
So,

29:31.890 --> 29:34.030
I wanted to quit.

29:34.050 --> 29:34.740
Where are you

29:34.740 --> 29:36.200
going in the future?

29:36.460 --> 29:38.220
Where could I go?

29:38.220 --> 29:38.930
Of course

29:38.930 --> 29:41.080
I'll keep serving you.

29:43.460 --> 29:44.870
I see. I see.

29:44.890 --> 29:47.390
I did lie to you.

29:47.410 --> 29:49.370
I'll do something to show my apology.

29:49.820 --> 29:51.560
What are you going to do?

29:59.980 --> 30:01.440
Hold on.

30:06.740 --> 30:08.080
What are you doing?

30:14.250 --> 30:15.680
Your Excellency.

30:16.380 --> 30:18.800
I'll treat you on tasty food. It's on me.

30:18.820 --> 30:21.720
Let's go enjoy ourselves.

30:29.930 --> 30:30.910
Hold on.

30:30.930 --> 30:33.290
I don't have enough money.

30:33.460 --> 30:35.360
I'll pay for 1.5 bowls of noodles.

30:35.380 --> 30:36.410
Can you give me two bowls?

30:36.410 --> 30:37.840
No. No way.

30:37.860 --> 30:39.410
I'm not done talking. Look.

30:39.620 --> 30:41.030
Only one bowl

30:41.050 --> 30:42.230
with minced meat.

30:42.250 --> 30:42.980
Just add some soup

30:42.980 --> 30:44.390
to the other bowl.

30:44.410 --> 30:46.030
Is it okay?

30:46.050 --> 30:47.230
Okay.

30:47.250 --> 30:48.600
You're flexible enough.

30:48.620 --> 30:49.960
Okay.

30:56.340 --> 30:57.360
Your Excellency.

30:57.380 --> 30:59.170
Here you are.

31:00.620 --> 31:01.720
Okay.

31:01.740 --> 31:03.840
It looks small in size,

31:04.460 --> 31:06.840
but the taste is very special.

31:06.860 --> 31:08.680
Enjoy it. I've paid for it.

31:08.700 --> 31:10.480
The two bowls of noodles look different.

31:11.770 --> 31:12.840
You're right.

31:12.860 --> 31:13.840
The essence of the noodles

31:13.860 --> 31:16.010
lies in the soup.

31:16.290 --> 31:19.480
You'll know its original taste and flavor like this.

31:19.500 --> 31:20.800
All the extra toppings

31:20.820 --> 31:22.030
have been omitted.

31:22.050 --> 31:23.320
They're omitted.

31:23.340 --> 31:23.700
Come on.

31:23.700 --> 31:25.170
Eat while they're hot.

31:25.700 --> 31:29.930
These toppings are unnecessary.

31:32.130 --> 31:33.250
Chen Pingping

31:33.250 --> 31:35.440
is a monster from Heaven.

31:35.460 --> 31:37.360
He looks different from us.

31:37.380 --> 31:38.720
Humans

31:38.740 --> 31:40.600
have two eyes,

31:40.620 --> 31:41.700
but Chen Pingping

31:41.700 --> 31:43.130
has three more eyes

31:43.130 --> 31:45.390
between the two like ours.

31:45.410 --> 31:47.910
Most of us have two arms,

31:47.930 --> 31:49.770
but Chen Pingping

31:49.770 --> 31:51.320
has two more on his back.

31:51.340 --> 31:55.010
With edged tools in his hands, he's awe-inspiring.

31:56.700 --> 31:58.480
Five eyes?

31:58.820 --> 31:59.990
Four arms?

32:00.010 --> 32:01.250
Exactly.

32:01.650 --> 32:03.080
His Excellency Chen

32:03.100 --> 32:06.080
is over three meters high.

32:06.930 --> 32:11.270
His face looks like a door plank
and his fist like a hammer.

32:11.290 --> 32:13.370
He has a large, fierce-looking mouth.

32:13.890 --> 32:16.410
When he shouts at the town,

32:16.410 --> 32:19.250
a roll of thunder

32:19.250 --> 32:21.650
will crash in the sky immediately.

32:22.250 --> 32:24.740
Every night,

32:24.740 --> 32:27.130
Chen Pingping would go to the army barracks of Beiqi

32:27.130 --> 32:30.910
and eat over ten soldiers.

32:30.930 --> 32:33.320
Having got used to it,

32:33.340 --> 32:35.700
the Beiqi forces draw lots

32:35.700 --> 32:38.200
to wait to be eaten by him.

32:38.220 --> 32:39.860
Dear all, in a word,

32:39.860 --> 32:42.250
Chen Pingping is brave and battlewise

32:42.250 --> 32:46.600
and can even move mountains.

33:00.100 --> 33:01.560
How do you like it, Your Excellency?

33:02.250 --> 33:03.560
Not bad.

33:03.860 --> 33:06.680
So, you've forgiven me, right?

33:06.700 --> 33:08.050
I have to think about it.

33:09.100 --> 33:10.500
Let me get you more soup.

33:10.500 --> 33:11.230
Okay?

33:11.250 --> 33:12.530
That's enough.

33:13.410 --> 33:14.600
Young Master.

33:14.860 --> 33:16.600
Why are you still here eating?

33:16.620 --> 33:17.870
Why are you here?

33:17.890 --> 33:20.410
I just listened to stories in the tea house.

33:20.620 --> 33:22.290
Why did you go there?

33:22.580 --> 33:23.500
Our bookstore

33:23.500 --> 33:24.750
is going to open.

33:24.770 --> 33:26.630
Why are you so neglectful?

33:26.650 --> 33:27.620
We should spend more time

33:27.620 --> 33:28.930
collecting relevant information.

33:29.820 --> 33:31.650
I just heard a new story.

33:31.770 --> 33:33.200
"Chen Pingping

33:33.290 --> 33:36.150
Travelled Hundreds of Miles to Beiqi Alone."

33:36.170 --> 33:37.390
It's amazing.

33:37.410 --> 33:38.680
If you write a book about it,

33:38.700 --> 33:40.010
it'll definitely sell well.

33:40.050 --> 33:41.230
Chen Pingping?

33:41.250 --> 33:42.600
Travelled hundreds of miles?

33:42.620 --> 33:43.840
Alone.

33:50.340 --> 33:51.720
Eunuch Hou.

33:55.100 --> 33:56.110
Mr. Fan.

33:56.130 --> 33:58.410
His Majesty wants to see you. It's urgent.

33:58.500 --> 34:00.230
I'm not done with the noodles.

34:00.250 --> 34:01.750
There is no time for delay.

34:01.770 --> 34:03.720
They're all waiting for you.

34:06.740 --> 34:08.730
Eunuch Hou, how did you know I was there?

34:08.900 --> 34:10.320
You were not at home,

34:10.380 --> 34:11.710
so I went to the Investigator's Office.

34:11.730 --> 34:13.450
Head Chen told me you were there.

34:14.530 --> 34:16.080
Chen Pingping?

34:16.690 --> 34:17.950
The Investigator's Office

34:17.970 --> 34:19.290
can find anyone

34:19.290 --> 34:21.510
in the capital city easily.

34:21.530 --> 34:23.360
He found me so quickly.

34:23.380 --> 34:25.320
He must have sent someone to tail after me.

34:25.730 --> 34:27.080
Mr. Fan,

34:27.100 --> 34:28.840
what Head Chen wants to do

34:28.860 --> 34:31.240
is not something we should think about.

34:36.580 --> 34:37.750
Young Master,

34:37.770 --> 34:39.250
your brother said

34:39.250 --> 34:40.880
he'd treat me on noodles,

34:40.900 --> 34:41.840
but he left

34:41.860 --> 34:43.080
before he paid.

34:43.100 --> 34:45.840
Can you give the money to me?

34:45.970 --> 34:47.240
I'll pay for it.

34:48.730 --> 34:49.840
How much?

34:52.290 --> 34:53.470
Three taels of silver.

34:53.490 --> 34:54.400
Three taels?

34:54.420 --> 34:55.890
Yeah. It's cheap.

34:56.100 --> 34:57.690
For the two bowls of noodles?

34:59.580 --> 35:00.970
Even without meat.

35:01.580 --> 35:03.400
It's profitable.

35:03.420 --> 35:04.920
More profitable than opening a bookstore.

35:04.940 --> 35:05.510
How about like this?

35:05.530 --> 35:06.210
I'll buy the store

35:06.210 --> 35:07.320
tomorrow.

35:07.340 --> 35:09.430
The money you paid today will be considered your shares.

35:09.450 --> 35:11.970
Great! I'll make a fortune.

35:13.900 --> 35:15.760
He wouldn't even pay a cent.

35:24.900 --> 35:27.190
Mr. Fan, hold on please.

35:27.210 --> 35:28.930
Let me tell His Majesty about it.

35:40.380 --> 35:41.690
Prime Minister.

35:42.690 --> 35:45.470
I saw you from the distance.

35:45.490 --> 35:48.520
You have nothing to lose by calling me uncle.

35:48.580 --> 35:50.880
Uncle, you're also here.

35:50.900 --> 35:52.230
His Majesty said

35:52.250 --> 35:54.730
it's something about Gong'er's death.

35:55.290 --> 35:56.430
It's a serious issue.

35:56.450 --> 35:58.080
Shall we talk about it just in the Imperial Study?

35:59.690 --> 36:03.800
With His Majesty there, there will be no room for maneuver.

36:09.050 --> 36:10.970
Prime Minister. Mr. Fan.

36:10.970 --> 36:12.450
This way, please.

36:16.140 --> 36:18.800
Don't be afraid. Follow me.

36:48.860 --> 36:50.280
Your Majesty.

36:50.420 --> 36:52.690
Prime Minister and Mr. Fan are here.

36:53.860 --> 36:55.130
Let them in.

37:01.010 --> 37:02.560
Your Majesty.

37:05.970 --> 37:07.360
They're here.

37:07.380 --> 37:08.510
You can make things clear

37:08.530 --> 37:10.600
in their presence.

37:13.420 --> 37:17.320
Prepare a seat and some tea for Prime Minister.

37:17.580 --> 37:19.130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

37:23.970 --> 37:25.840
Your Majesty, how about me?

37:27.690 --> 37:29.000
You?

37:30.050 --> 37:31.650
Just stand here.

37:33.690 --> 37:36.880
Your Highness, you don't need to bow to me.

37:36.900 --> 37:38.920
The Investigator's Office has checked Lin Gong's body.

37:38.940 --> 37:41.410
He was killed by a skilled swordsman with a fast sword.

37:41.530 --> 37:43.210
Among all swordsmen in the capital city,

37:44.210 --> 37:46.730
only Xie Bi'an that works for the Second Prince

37:46.860 --> 37:48.560
has the ability to do that.

37:48.820 --> 37:50.320
Do you mean...

37:50.340 --> 37:51.250
He means

37:51.250 --> 37:53.280
I'm the one who killed Lin Gong.

37:54.380 --> 37:56.520
Are you the killer?

37:56.860 --> 37:58.600
You have to ask Fan Xian about it.

37:59.250 --> 38:00.160
Your Highness,

38:00.180 --> 38:01.840
how is it related to me?

38:02.210 --> 38:03.860
During 9 a.m. to 11 a.m. of the day
when Lin Gong was killed,

38:03.860 --> 38:05.490
I happened to meet Fan Xian on the street

38:05.490 --> 38:05.940
and we had a small talk.

38:05.940 --> 38:08.080
Xie Bi'an was also there.

38:08.100 --> 38:09.800
I just asked you to be here to give witness.

38:10.290 --> 38:11.230
Xie Bi'an is known as

38:11.250 --> 38:13.030
"Faster than Light."

38:13.050 --> 38:14.120
He is the best swordsman

38:14.140 --> 38:16.690
in the capital city.

38:16.940 --> 38:18.430
Faster than light?

38:18.450 --> 38:19.760
Fast sword.

38:20.580 --> 38:21.760
Is it true?

38:22.770 --> 38:23.920
Yes.

38:23.940 --> 38:26.320
The Investigator's Office has confirmed

38:26.580 --> 38:28.760
Lin Gong was killed during 9 a.m. to 11 a.m.

38:28.860 --> 38:30.030
In this case,

38:30.050 --> 38:31.970
Xie Bi'an didn't have enough time

38:31.970 --> 38:33.800
to rush out of town to do that.

38:33.820 --> 38:35.210
There is another possibility.

38:35.820 --> 38:37.140
Fan Xian and you joined hands

38:37.140 --> 38:39.510
to let Xie Bi'an kill Lin Gong.

38:39.530 --> 38:41.710
He was giving false testimony

38:41.730 --> 38:42.600
to help you stay out of it.

38:42.620 --> 38:44.280
It's more ridiculous.

38:44.770 --> 38:46.450
Why did I want to kill Lin Gong?

38:46.620 --> 38:48.560
Why did Fan Xian want to do that?

38:48.580 --> 38:51.160
Lin Gong is the one behind
the assassination attempt on Niulan Street.

38:51.180 --> 38:52.640
Fan Xian holds a grudge against him.

38:52.660 --> 38:53.510
Your Highness,

38:53.530 --> 38:55.080
I have no idea about that.

38:55.100 --> 38:56.450
He's the Crown Prince.

38:56.450 --> 38:58.600
We have to bear it if he wants to declare us guilty.

38:58.770 --> 39:00.230
Then tell me

39:00.250 --> 39:02.080
who else is so skilled at swordsmanship

39:02.100 --> 39:03.670
if it's not Xie Bi'an.

39:03.690 --> 39:04.770
It's not hard

39:04.770 --> 39:05.380
to hire a sword master

39:05.380 --> 39:06.710
who is unrecognized, right?

39:06.730 --> 39:08.140
To whom are you making pointed allusions?

39:08.140 --> 39:09.470
I'm just trying to reason.

39:09.490 --> 39:11.130
It's enough.

39:20.580 --> 39:22.080
Prime Minister,

39:23.180 --> 39:25.930
the victim is your son. What do you think?

39:28.380 --> 39:30.000
In my opinion,

39:32.100 --> 39:33.890
the person to blame

39:39.970 --> 39:42.000
is Chen Pingping.

39:42.860 --> 39:47.280
The Investigator's Office is responsible
for the safety of the capital city.

39:47.730 --> 39:50.280
Up to now, they haven't reported

39:50.450 --> 39:52.800
the truth about my son's death.

39:53.580 --> 39:55.080
It means Chen Pingping

39:55.250 --> 39:59.280
has neglected his duties.

40:01.010 --> 40:02.800
It makes sense.

40:04.900 --> 40:08.120
I hope to

40:08.140 --> 40:10.160
confront Chen Pingping

40:10.180 --> 40:12.520
and see him be punished according to law.

40:31.940 --> 40:34.320
It seems you enjoy standing there.

40:34.450 --> 40:36.800
Your Majesty, shall I kneel down?

40:38.900 --> 40:40.240
Rise.

40:42.820 --> 40:44.240
Send an imperial decree

40:44.580 --> 40:46.490
and ask Chen Pingping to come here.

40:47.250 --> 40:48.890
Got it.

41:05.420 --> 41:07.170
Chen Pingping!

41:08.420 --> 41:08.940
Your Majesty.

41:08.940 --> 41:10.490
Do you know your sin?

41:11.450 --> 41:12.930
Why do you say that?

41:13.140 --> 41:14.750
The Prime Minister's son was killed.

41:14.770 --> 41:16.340
As Head of

41:16.340 --> 41:17.560
the Investigator's Office,

41:17.580 --> 41:20.230
you haven't found out the killer up to now.

41:20.250 --> 41:21.640
You have to take responsibility.

41:21.660 --> 41:23.080
Your Majesty,

41:24.210 --> 41:26.320
we've found out the killer.

41:27.940 --> 41:29.560
You found it out?

41:30.340 --> 41:31.600
Good.

41:31.620 --> 41:35.400
In the presence of Prime Minister and others,

41:35.420 --> 41:37.650
tell me who is the killer.

41:45.290 --> 41:46.650
Prime Minister,

41:47.860 --> 41:50.930
I'm surprised to hear the sad news upon my return.

41:51.210 --> 41:54.450
I'm sorry for your loss.

41:55.100 --> 41:56.970
Who is the killer?

41:59.580 --> 42:03.170
Si Gujian from Dongyi Town.

42:03.690 --> 42:04.920
One of the Great Masters?

42:04.940 --> 42:05.950
If it were not a Great Master,

42:05.970 --> 42:08.210
who else could use a sword so quickly?

42:09.620 --> 42:10.950
As a Great Master,

42:10.970 --> 42:13.080
he travelled hundreds of miles to the capital city

42:13.100 --> 42:15.430
to kill the Prime Minister's son?

42:15.450 --> 42:17.730
Why did he do that?

42:21.100 --> 42:23.730
Lin Gong joined hands with Si Lili

42:23.770 --> 42:25.990
to try to assassinate Fan Xian on Niulan Street,

42:26.010 --> 42:27.670
but Si Gujian lost a disciple and a follower

42:27.690 --> 42:29.400
during the process.

42:29.420 --> 42:30.920
The two female assassinators

42:30.940 --> 42:32.560
were killed by Fan Xian.

42:32.580 --> 42:33.800
Why did Si Gujian kill Lin Gong

42:33.820 --> 42:35.560
to take revenge?

42:35.580 --> 42:37.030
Everyone knows that

42:37.050 --> 42:39.710
Si Gujian is obsessed with swordsmanship.

42:39.730 --> 42:41.170
Fan Xian killed the two assassinators

42:41.210 --> 42:43.730
when he was attacked.

42:43.770 --> 42:45.100
Si Gujian would think highly of him

42:45.100 --> 42:46.320
because of his capabilities.

42:46.340 --> 42:48.410
And he'd only take revenge on

42:48.620 --> 42:52.190
Lin Gong and Beiqi

42:52.210 --> 42:55.890
that are behind all this.

43:19.240 --> 43:22.820
In the river of history,

43:22.840 --> 43:26.310
time goes round and round.

43:29.120 --> 43:32.460
Memories about the former and present lives

43:32.480 --> 43:36.550
join each other in an endless way.

43:38.440 --> 43:41.060
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:41.080 --> 43:43.320
one season follows another in a flash,

43:43.320 --> 43:45.820
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:45.840 --> 43:47.440
I just can't give up

43:47.440 --> 43:50.780
to be with you for my whole life.

43:50.800 --> 43:56.270
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:57.520 --> 44:00.070
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:00.360 --> 44:02.400
Year after year in the wandering,

44:02.400 --> 44:05.060
I count the remaining years.

44:05.080 --> 44:07.260
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:07.280 --> 44:09.270
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:09.560 --> 44:11.950
I never feel regretful.

44:12.000 --> 44:13.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:13.360 --> 44:16.340
I still miss you as ever.

44:16.360 --> 44:19.310
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:19.600 --> 44:21.660
With a gentle heart,

44:21.680 --> 44:24.340
I cherish our remaining years.

44:24.360 --> 44:25.880
Even though we have to go through

44:25.880 --> 44:28.390
all the hardships along the journey,

44:28.520 --> 44:35.710
you always stay by my side,

44:35.800 --> 44:38.470
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:38.760 --> 44:40.840
Year after year in the wandering,

44:40.840 --> 44:43.500
I count the remaining years.

44:43.520 --> 44:45.660
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:45.680 --> 44:47.910
even though we end up the destiny,

44:48.120 --> 44:50.300
I never feel regretful.

44:50.320 --> 44:51.720
In such a chaotic world,

44:51.720 --> 44:54.780
I still miss you as ever.

44:54.800 --> 44:57.910
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:58.000 --> 45:00.140
With a gentle heart,

45:00.160 --> 45:02.860
I cherish our remaining years.

45:02.880 --> 45:04.320
Even though we have to go through

45:04.320 --> 45:06.980
all the hardships along the journey,

45:07.000 --> 45:15.760
you always stay by my side...
